        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SWP4754 Single Rocker Solid Brass Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPut the finishing touches on your home with a single rocker switch or outlet plate. It is available in 8 finishes including matte black, satin nickel and rubbed oil bronze. This solid brass rocker switch cover is used with Decora style electrical outlets or switches and is made by Deltana to provide the perfect accent to your home or office.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SWP4754.gif?v=1704354769\" width=\"304\" height=\"354\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana SWP4754 Single Switch Plate Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/double-rocker-cover-deltana-swp4741\"><b>Double Switch Plate</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/triple-rocker-cover-deltana-swp4740\"><b>Triple Switch Plate</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/quadruple-rocker-cover-deltana-swp4744\"><b>Quad Switch Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana SWP4754 Single Rocker Solid Brass Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Switch Hole Length: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Switch Hole Width: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw Hole Spacing: 3-7/8\"center to center</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SWP4754-specifications.pdf?v=1704262298\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SWP4754 Single Switch Plate Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
